error[E0003]: `/0` names a device, not one of its streams
 --> stream_path.tsl:1:17
  |
1 | source device = /0 @rate(1000) @channels(x)
  |                 ^^
  |
  = help: a stream path is `/route/stream` or `/route/stream/column`,
          such as `/0/field` or `/0/field/x`

error[E0003]: `/0/field/x/y` has parts after its column
 --> stream_path.tsl:2:15
  |
2 | source deep = /0/field/x/y @rate(1000)
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: a stream path is `/route/stream` or `/route/stream/column`,
          such as `/0/field` or `/0/field/x`

error[E0003]: `300` is not a route hop, which is a number from 0 to 255
 --> stream_path.tsl:3:14
  |
3 | source hop = /300/field @rate(1000) @channels(x)
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: a stream path is `/route/stream` or `/route/stream/column`,
          such as `/0/field` or `/0/field/x`

error[E0003]: a stream path names something after each `/`
 --> stream_path.tsl:4:17
  |
